Description:You control four Plains and have Replenish in hand; Control Magic is in your graveyard. The opponent controls Gladecover Scout (hexproof) and Grizzly Bears. End the turn controlling Gladecover Scout.
Rule:wizards-official-card-rulings-a9e1f3854f20309a | An Aura put onto the battlefield without being cast does not target what it enchants (CR 303.4f), so it can be attached to a hexproof creature
